                  <p class="prism-ui">Arrives along −(lvx, lvy); its shadow settles 2q later.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="guide-table-wrap">
          <table class="guide-table">
            <caption>Geometry / choose the family before the size</caption>
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Family</th><th scope="col">Values</th><th scope="col">Rule</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><th scope="row">Radius</th><td>10 / 16 / 24px</td><td>Control / foil / surface. Button sizes step 7–14px.</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Boundary</th><td>1.5px edge · 1px hairline · 2px seam</td><td>Keep the roles distinct; heavier edges flatten hierarchy.</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Spacing</th><td>1rem · 1.5rem · 2.5–3rem</td><td>Component gap, group gap, section space.</td></tr>
